# Credential and environment material. This file exists BEFORE any source lands in this
# repository, deliberately: the release tree is assembled from a wiped subset of a private
# archive, and the cheapest place to stop a credential is before it is ever staged.
#
# Nothing here is a substitute for the scrub. It is the second of three layers:
#   1. the allowlist   -- only approved paths are copied into this tree at all
#   2. this .gitignore -- shapes that must never be staged even if copied
#   3. CI secret scan  -- a gate on every push and pull request
# A finding at layer 3 means layers 1 and 2 both failed and the assembly is wrong.

# --- environment and secrets -------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.env
secrets/
.secrets/
*.secret
*.secrets
credentials.json
*credential*
*-credentials*
auth.json
.sops.yaml
.sops/
*.kubeconfig
kubeconfig
kubeconfig.*

# --- keys and certificates ---------------------------------------------------
*.pem
*.key
!**/testdata/**/*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
id_rsa
id_rsa.*
id_ed25519
id_ed25519.*
*.ppk
known_hosts

# --- tokens -----------------------------------------------------------------
*.token
.netrc
_netrc
.npmrc
.pypirc

# --- model weights and large binaries ---------------------------------------
# A source release does not ship weights. These are fetched at run time.
*.gguf
*.safetensors
*.bin
*.onnx
*.pt
*.pth
models/
model-cache/

# --- python -----------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
build/
dist/

# --- node -------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
.pnpm-store/

# --- local state and scratch -------------------------------------------------
*.log
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db
data/
volumes/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/

# --- never publish the assembly working material ----------------------------
_scrub/
_preimages/
_defect-fixes/
WIPE-LEDGER.md
